,Use Grid

,**Set up Extruded Handles (Selected with Door in KCD)
Displayset, #exthandlename=Aluminum Extruded Handles-specify finish, What is your extruded handle name?
,**
Displayset, #exthandlesize1=24IN, What is your small size price point?
Displayset, #extrudedhandlecost1=28, Cost for smallest?
,**
Displayset, #exthandlesize2=48IN, What is your Medium size price point?
Displayset, #extrudedhandlecost2=28, Cost for Medium?
,**
Displayset, #exthandlesize3=96IN, What is your Large size price point?
Displayset, #extrudedhandlecost3=56, Cost for Large?
,**

